# Search-tool ignore (ripgrep, fd, most IDE indexers) — NOT a .gitignore.
# The vendored submodule working trees are 84% of the files in the checkout
# (gxepd2 bitmaps alone are ~362k lines) but only a handful compile; keep
# them out of search results. git grep already skips submodules.
# Use `rg --no-ignore` to search them deliberately.
components/*/upstream/
